    "turn_idx": 70,
    "turn_text": "Well, it stems from, I'm biased. Obviously, I've been an outspoken critic of Putin and the Russian government for many, many years. And some of it's based upon my three years on the Czechoslovakian border during the old days, and we had fences and walls and guards and end stuff. Then it morphed when I got elected to a member of Congress, Shimkus, his ethnically",
